### Create Customer

POST http://localhost:8080/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Charlie",
  "email": "charlie@example.com"
}

###

### Create Product 1

POST http://localhost:8080/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Keyboard",
  "price": 80
}

###

### Create Product 2

POST http://localhost:8080/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Monitor",
  "price": 300
}

###

### Create Order with TWO items

POST http://localhost:8080/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": 1,
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": 1,
      "quantity": 1
    },
    {
      "productId": 2,
      "quantity": 1
    }
  ]
}

###

### Check all order items

GET http://localhost:8080/order-items

### Remove one item from Order 2

DELETE http://localhost:8080/orders/2/items/3

### Verify Order 2 still exists

GET http://localhost:8080/orders/2

###

### Verify remaining items

GET http://localhost:8080/order-items